sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client as 设计工作台或 Agent
  participant API as Hono API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Dispatcher as Outbox Dispatcher
  participant Queue as Redis/BullMQ
  participant Worker as AssetTaskWorker
  participant Provider as 图片或文本 Provider
  participant Poller as Event Poller
  participant Consumer as UI 或 Agent JobWake

  Client->>API: 提交单张、批量或 Agent 生图请求
  API->>API: 校验归属并冻结 payload
  API->>PG: BEGIN 写 task、pending artifact、Outbox
  PG-->>API: COMMIT task_id
  API-->>Client: 201 accepted + task_id

  loop Outbox 投递
    Dispatcher->>PG: claim pending Outbox
    Dispatcher->>Queue: add(jobId = task_id, payload)
    Queue-->>Dispatcher: 已存在或入队成功
    Dispatcher->>PG: 标记 enqueued
  end

  Queue->>Worker: 分发 Job
  Worker->>PG: 读取任务并 tryMarkRunning
  alt 已终态或已取消
    PG-->>Worker: 保存的终态
    Worker-->>Queue: 返回，不重复执行
  else 可执行 image.generate
    Worker->>PG: 检查取消意图和 generation operation
    Worker->>Provider: 使用稳定 operation id 请求生成
    alt Provider 明确成功
      Provider-->>Worker: 图片结果
      Worker->>PG: CAS 追加版本、推进资产、写 succeeded 事件
      Worker->>PG: 事务受理 artifact.name 与 Outbox
    else Provider 结果不明确
      Provider--xWorker: 超时且无法查询结果
      Worker->>PG: 写 needs_review 事件
    else 明确失败或取消
      Provider-->>Worker: 明确错误或取消
      Worker->>PG: 写 failed 或 cancelled 事件
    end
  end

  opt 图片成功后的软命名任务
    Dispatcher->>PG: claim 命名 Outbox
    Dispatcher->>Queue: 入队 artifact.name
    Queue->>Worker: 分发命名 Job
    Worker->>Provider: 请求短名称
    Provider-->>Worker: 模型名称
    Worker->>PG: generation token 条件写回并写终态事件
  end

  loop 持久事件消费
    Poller->>PG: 拉取未消费 task.terminal
    Poller->>Consumer: UI 状态更新或 Agent JobWake
    Poller->>PG: 标记事件已消费
  end
